ke_along_axis` works with sharding on 2D arrays, but throws an IndexError with 3D arrays, e.g.\r\n\r\n```python\r\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\r\nfrom jax.experimental import mesh_utils\r\nfrom jax.sharding import PositionalSharding\r\n\r\nsharding = PositionalSharding(mesh_utils.create_device_mesh((4,)))\r\n\r\nx = jnp.zeros((4,10))\r\ny = jnp.ones((4,), jnp.int32)\r\nx = jax.device_put(x, sharding.reshape(4, 1))\r\ny = jax.device_put(y, sharding)\r\n\r\nout = jnp.take_along_axis(x, y[..., None], -1)\r\n# works as expected: \r\n# Array([[0.],\r\n#        [0.],\r\n#        [0.],\r\n#        [0.]], dtype=float32)\r\n\r\nx2 = jnp.tile(x, (2, 1, 1))\r\ny2 = jnp.tile(y, (2, 1))\r\n\r\nout2 = jnp.take_along_axis(x2, y2[..., None], -1)\r\n# throws IndexError, see below\r\n\r\nx3 = jax.device_put(x2, jax.devices()[0])\r\ny3 = jax.device_put(y3, jax.devices()[0])\r\n\r\nout3 = jnp.take_along_axis(x3, y3[..., None], -1)\r\n# works as expected: \r\n# Array([[[0.],\r\n#        [0.],\r\n#        [0.],\r\n#        [0.]],\r\n#\r\n#       [[0.],\r\n#        [0.],\r\n#        [0.],\r\n#        [0.]]], dtype=float32)\r\n```\r\n\r\nFor `out2`, the following exception is thrown.:\r\n```\r\n    [... skipping hidden 14 frame]\r\n\r\nFile /p/project/jinm60/users/tran4/env_llfs/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/dispatch.py:464, in backend_compile(backend, module, options, host_callbacks)\r\n    459   return backend.compile(built_c, compile_options=options,\r\n    460                          host_callbacks=host_callbacks)\r\n    461 # Some backends don't have `host_callbacks` option yet\r\n    462 # TODO(sharadmv): remove this fallback when all backends allow `compile`\r\n    463 # to take in `host_callbacks`\r\n--> 464 return backend.compile(built_c, compile_options=options)\r\n\r\nIndexError: `InlinedVector::at(size_type) const` failed bounds check\r\n```\r\n\r\n\n\n### What jax/jaxlib version are you using?\n\njax v0.4.14, jaxlib 0.4.14+cuda12.cudnn89\n\n### Which accelerator(s) are you using?\n\nGPU\n\n### Additional system info\n\nPython 3.11, Rocky Linux 8.8, cf. https://apps.fz-juelich.de/jsc/hps/jureca/configuration.html\n\n### NVIDIA GPU info\n\n```\r\nWed Sep 13 11:15:39 2023       \r\n+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\r\n| NVIDIA-SMI 535.54.03              Driver Version: 535.54.03    CUDA Version: 12.2     |\r\n|-----------------------------------------+----------------------+----------------------+\r\n| GPU  Name                 Persistence-M | Bus-Id        Disp.A | Volatile Uncorr. ECC |\r\n| Fan  Temp   Perf          Pwr:Usage/Cap |         Memory-Usage | GPU-Util  Compute M. |\r\n|                                         |                      |               MIG M. |\r\n|=========================================+======================+======================|\r\n|   0  NVIDIA A100-SXM4-40GB          On  | 00000000:03:00.0 Off |                    0 |\r\n| N/A   45C    P0              67W / 400W |  31584MiB / 40960MiB |      0%      Default |\r\n|                                         |                      |             Disabled |\r\n+-----------------------------------------+----------------------+----------------------+\r\n|   1  NVIDIA A100-SXM4-40GB          On  | 00000000:44:00.0 Off |                    0 |\r\n| N/A   45C    P0              68W / 400W |  31602MiB / 40960MiB |      0%      Default |\r\n|                                         |                      |             Disabled |\r\n+-----------------------------------------+----------------------+----------------------+\r\n|   2  NVIDIA A100-SXM4-40GB          On  | 00000000:84:00.0 Off |                    0 |\r\n| N/A   45C    P0              65W / 400W |  31602MiB / 40960MiB |      0%      Default |\r\n|                                         |                      |             Disabled |\r\n+-----------------------------------------+----------------------+----------------------+\r\n|   3  NVIDIA A100-SXM4-40GB          On  | 00000000:C4:00.0 Off |                    0 |\r\n| N/A   45C    P0              70W / 400W |  31578MiB / 40960MiB |      0%      Default |\r\n|                                         |                      |             Disabled |\r\n+-----------------------------------------+----------------------+----------------------+\r\n                                                                                         \r\n+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\r\n| Processes:                                                                            |\r\n|  GPU   GI   CI        PID   Type   Process name                            GPU Memory |\r\n|        ID   ID                                                             Usage      |\r\n|=======================================================================================|\r\n|    0   N/A  N/A     21742      C   ...60/users/tran4/env_llfs/bin/python3    31566MiB |\r\n|    1   N/A  N/A     21742      C   ...60/users/tran4/env_llfs/bin/python3    31584MiB |\r\n|    2   N/A  N/A     21742      C   ...60/users/tran4/env_llfs/bin/python3    31584MiB |\r\n|    3   N/A  N/A     21742      C   ...60/users/tran4/env_llfs/bin/python3    31560MiB |\r\n+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\r\n```","closed_at":"2024-04-19T17:07:09Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.co